  m_text: 'public puts a variable in the Inspector, where it can be changed or keyed on a Timeline. private means only its own script can use it. In HiddenValue, speed is public and angle is private. A component can show a private variable, greyed out, with [SerializeField, ReadOnly]: a value to watch, not to change.


    <b>Predict:</b> HiddenValue declares speed and angle. Which of the two does the Inspector show?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Press Play, select Bar 4, and open Code Watch: it lists speed and angle.

    2. In the Inspector, change Speed.

    3. Select Gravity, beside E4: Start Gravity is private, greyed out under Private (read-only).'
