  m_text: 'SunController holds one number, timeOfDay. Every frame, Update turns it into three values: the sun''s angle (15 degrees an hour), the sun''s intensity (strongest at noon, 0 at night) and the fog''s color. The sun lights the whole scene, so every stand changes with it.


    <b>Predict:</b> You set Time Of Day to 18. What is the Intensity of the Sun?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Press Play, select Clock 7, and drag Time Of Day from 6 to 18.

    2. Select Sun and watch its Rotation and Intensity.

    3. Set Time Of Day to 18 and check your answer.'
