  m_text: "<b>Exercise \xB7 Change</b>\n\n<b>Task:</b>\n1. In ChangeFog.cs, add a public Color, fogColor, with a tooltip, and a line in Update that writes it into RenderSettings.fogColor.\n2. Tick ChangeFog on Fog E3. Untick FogController on Fog 5 and SunController on Clock 7: they write the same fog.\n3. Press Play, raise Density, and change Fog Color."
