  m_text: "The Timeline can key only values on a component in the scene, and the fog is not one. FogController is the bridge: the Timeline keys density, a public variable of Fog 5, and Update writes it into the fog. This Timeline raises density from 0.01 to 0.08 and back, in eight seconds.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> While the Timeline plays, does the line in FogController's Update still run every frame?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play, click 6 \xB7 Play the Timeline, and select Fog 5: watch Density.\n2. Select Timeline 6. Open Window \u203A Sequencing \u203A Timeline.\n3. On the Animation track, find the keys of Density."
